        <field name="sequence">120</field>
        <field name="tile_group">year_end</field>
        <field name="filing_section">year_end</field>
        <field name="year_start_month">1</field>
        <field name="name">Annual personal income tax finalisation 05/QTT-TNCN (tax year 2026 onwards)</field>
        <field name="official_name">Tờ khai quyết toán thuế thu nhập cá nhân — Mẫu số 05/QTT-TNCN (Thông tư 89/2026/TT-BTC)</field>
        <field name="authority">Tax office</field>
        <field name="period_kind">tax_year</field>
        <field name="output_kinds">xlsx,pdf</field>
        <field name="total_line_code">33</field>
        <field name="valid_from">2026-01-01</field>
        <field name="screen_note">The year-end declaration in its own line order with appendices 05-1, 05-2 and 05-3 as sheets, and a tax-withheld statement for each person.</field>
        <field name="source_url">https://amis.misa.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/89_15072026_180604.pdf</field>
        <field name="source_note">Thông tư 89/2026/TT-BTC (signed 30 June 2026, in force 1 July 2026), Mẫu số 05/QTT-TNCN and its appendices 05-1/BK-QTT-TNCN, 05-2/BK-QTT-TNCN, 05-3/BK-QTT-TNCN, read from the signed text published by MISA (https://amis.misa.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/89_15072026_180604.pdf, pages 312-318). Employee certificate: Nghị định 254/2026/NĐ-CP Điều 23-24 and the sample template 03/TNCN of Thông tư 91/2026/TT-BTC Phụ lục V. Read on 18 November 2026.</field>
        <field name="inferred_note">The official files were read from copies published by others (MISA, VCCI), not from the Ministry's own site. Who counts as "with a labour contract" ([16] and appendix 05-1) is not checked: every tax resident is counted and listed on 05-1, every non-resident on 05-2. Part II counts the people HR marked "Asked us to settle year-end tax" for the year (they get no certificate); its balance lines need the tax due for the year from a pay item: Payobook does not work tax out again. The per-person certificate is an information copy laid out like the sample 03/TNCN; Payobook gives it no official series or number.</field>
        <field name="employee_certificates" eval="True"/>
        <field name="inferred" eval="True"/>
    </record>
